+**Criterion 7: MISS.** The gate is *every one of the ten* ≤ 16.67 ms warm.
+**Six of ten miss**, four pass. The worst is `CommandApplied` at **26.93 ms —
+162% of the budget**; the best is `band back` at **13.53 ms**, comfortably
